Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,明斯克 白俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minsk Belarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头开始 源源本本告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what happened from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去泡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had been to a bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒吧不错 我开始和一个女招待搭讪\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice place, and, er, I got chatting with one of the waitresses,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦她很不高兴 后来回到酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Karen weren't happy with that, so…when we get back to the hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吵起来 打了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}we end up having a bit of a ding-dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她老是讽刺我 说我不似个真爷们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's always getting at me, saying I weren't a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不「是」个真爷们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 「不是」 你说的「不似」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's not "weren't", it's "wasn't".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我也不知怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…then I don't know how it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然我手里就多了把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}but suddenly there's a knife in my hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:01:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爹是个屠户 所以我会使刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and me old man was a butcher, so I know how to handle knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫我们肢解野兽 - 「教」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He learned us how to cut up a beast. - Taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 「教」你们肢解野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Taught you how to cut up a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 反正 我就动作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, then I done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「动手」 - 动手 捅了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did it. - Did it! Stabbed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刀一刀又一刀 等我低头看 她经已…\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over and over, and I looked down, and she weren't…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「已经」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wasn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会东了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…moving no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不会动了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 我真不知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me, I dunno how it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是意外 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was an accident, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定得帮我 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to help me, Mr Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都说你是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone says you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为这个被挂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get hung for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 贝维克先生 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Mr Bewick, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,绞死倒是会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanged, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:59.78,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:29.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,《致命游戏》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无聊 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bored. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无聊 - 别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bored! - No…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道如今的犯罪阶层都怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know what's got into the criminal classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我不是其中一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你拿墙出气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you take it out on the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wall had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 俄罗斯那案子呢？- 白俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about that Russian case? - Belarus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老一套家庭情杀 浪费我时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open and shut domestic murder. Not worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可惜哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里有吃的没？我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything in? I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我草…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, f…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 砍掉的人头 - 我就要茶 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A severed head! - Just tea for me, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 冰箱里有个人头 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, there's a head in the fridge. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是人头喂 - 唉 我还能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A bloody head! - Well, where else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在哪呢？你不介意的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I supposed to put it? You don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃… - 从巴兹医学院太平间拿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well… - Got it from Barts morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在测量人死后唾液的凝结速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm measuring the coagulation of saliva after death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你写的出租司机案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've written up the taxi driver case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er…yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「粉色的研究」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Study In Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 粉红女郎 粉红箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know. Pink lady, pink case,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉红手机 全是粉红 你喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}pink phone. There was a lot of pink. Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃 不喜欢 - 为什么？我以为你会得意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um…no. - Why not? I thought you'd be flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,得意？「夏洛克能瞬间看穿一切人和事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flattered?! "Sherlock sees through everything and everyone in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,「然而神奇的是 他同时也在某些方面」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's incredible, though, is how spectacularly ignorant he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「极其无知」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"about some things."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我不是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, I didn't mean that…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你这个「极其无知」是夸我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you meant "spectacularly ignorant" in a nice way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不在乎谁是首相或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it doesn't matter to me who's Prime Minister or…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 谁和谁有奸情\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - Who's sleeping with who…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球是否绕着太阳转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether the Earth goes round the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是这个 这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That again! It's not important!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不重要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not impor…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小学知识 你怎能不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's primary school stuff. How can you not know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算知道过 我也删除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I ever did, I've deleted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,删除了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deleted it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这是我的硬盘 唯一合理做法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. This is my hard drive, and it only makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只存进有用的东西 真正有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put things in there that are useful. REALLY useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通人总在脑子里塞满垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ordinary people fill their heads with all kinds of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用的信息都找不到了 明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes it hard to get at the stuff that matters. Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这是太阳系的问题啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the solar system!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 有什么意义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell! What does that matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绕太阳转 要是改成绕月亮转\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go round the sun. If we went round the moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者像小熊一样绕着花园转圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}or round and round the garden like a teddy bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不也一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wouldn't make any difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我唯一重要的是工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that matters to me is the work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.71,0:05:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有工作 我脑子都要锈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without that, my brain rots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,写进你博客里去 或者行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that in your blog! Or, better still,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再拿你的高见折磨全世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop inflicting your opinions on the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪？- 外面 我需要新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Out! I need some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 亲爱的 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, sorry, love! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟 你们俩发生家庭纠纷了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh-ooh! Have you two had a little domestic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面天气冷飕飕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, it's a bit nippy out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该多穿点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should have wrapped himself up a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看外面 赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that, Mrs Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉静 安详\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm. Peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,何其可恶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it hateful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 总会出点事的 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sure something will turn up, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出个漂亮的凶杀案 你就会开心啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice murder. That'll cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 绝对是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Can't come too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你把我的墙壁怎么了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what have you done to my bloody wall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个算在你房租里 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting this on your rent, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 哦 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Oh…m-morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 就说你该用气垫床的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Told you you should have gone with the Lilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 没事 我睡得挺好 谢谢你好心收留\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, it's fine, I slept fine. It's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许下次我会让你睡在我被角上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe next time I'll let you kip at the end of my bed, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「被埋没在…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which was discovered mouldering…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再下次呢？- 「18个月前被发现」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the time after that? - 18 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「专家将之誉为本世纪最大艺术发现」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experts are hailing it as the artistic find of the century…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要早餐吗？- 好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want some breakfast? - Love some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己做吧 我去洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, make it yourself. I'm going to have a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「最终售价高达一千万镑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It fetched over 20 million ponds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这一件有望拍出更高价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is anticipated to do even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到头条新闻「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back now to our main story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「伦敦中心区发生了一起大爆炸」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a massive explosion in central London.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「目前 还没有伤亡报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}As yet, there are no reports of any casualties,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方无法确认「\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the police are unable to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这是否与恐怖分子有关」\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's any suspicion of terrorist involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 - 「警方公布了紧急电话」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah! - Police have issued an emergency number…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 - 「供当事人亲友联络」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah! - …for friends and relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry! I've got to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 借过一下 抱歉 借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, can I get through? Excuse me. Can I get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.47,0:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电视上看见了 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it on the telly. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？什么？哦 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? What? Oh, yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是煤气泄漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas leak, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - Can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手头的案子太多了 抽不出空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff I've got on is just too big. I can't spare the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管你那些鸡毛蒜皮了 这是国家大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind your usual trivia. This is of national importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,节食成果如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the diet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能说通他 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you can get through to him, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我弟弟有时就是这么顽固\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid my brother can be very intransigent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么热心 你自己去调查呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're so keen, why don't you investigate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我一刻也不能离开办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can't possibly be away from the office for any length of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩国大选就要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with the Korean elections so…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你也懒得知道 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't need to know about that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 这种案子需要…跑腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, a case like this, it requires…legwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉还好吗 约翰？气垫床如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Sarah, John? How was the Lilo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙发 夏洛克 他睡的沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sofa, Sherlock. It was the sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 当然 - 怎么… 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yes, of course. - How…? Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克的生意日见红火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock's business seems to be booming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你和他结成…\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you and he became…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 和他同居感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}pals. What's he like to live with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苦不堪言吧 - 我从不无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hellish, I imagine. - I'm never bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 那太好了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. That's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁·韦斯特 朋友叫他小韦 公务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrew West, known as Westie to his friends. Civil servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体今早在巴特西（伦敦西南）车站铁轨上出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found dead on the tracks at Battersea station this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑浆迸裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his head smashed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧轨自杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumped in front of a train?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺理成章的推断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems the logical assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是 - 可是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But? - But?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是事故你也不会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wouldn't be here if it was just an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部在开发新的反导弹系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The MoD is working on a new missile defence system,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人称布鲁斯-帕廷顿计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Bruce-Partington Program it's called.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划存在一根记忆棒里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plans for it were on a memory stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怎么明智啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是唯一一份 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not the only copy. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可也是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且遗失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶级机密？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝密 我们认为记忆棒可能被韦斯特拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very. We think West must have taken the memory stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让它流入外人手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't risk it falling into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得找到这份计划 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to find those plans, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别逼我命令你 - 你倒是试试呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't make me order you. - I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 约翰 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, John. - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会再见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么撒谎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闲得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got nothing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没案子 墙都差点被你拆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a single case. That's why the wall took a pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么告诉你哥哥你很忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you tell your brother you were busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟斗气 这倒真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sibling rivalry. Now we're getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我怎么会拒绝呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. How could I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁 - 是雷斯垂德 我被召唤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - Lestrade, I've been summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要你要我来 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. If you want me to. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开我的博客作家 我就不知所措了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be lost without my blogger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢好玩的案子 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like the funny cases, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有惊喜的案子 - 显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The surprising ones. - Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个爆炸案包你满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll love this. That explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 煤气泄漏吧？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gas leak, yes? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 故意做了那种幌子 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Made to look like one. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,整片都炸成白地了 就剩一个保险箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly anything left of the place, except a strongbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常保险的保险箱 里面是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A VERY strong box, and inside it was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没拆开？- 写明给你的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You haven't opened it? - It's addressed to you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,照过X光了 没有机关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've X-rayed it. It's not booby-trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人安心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏洛克·福尔摩斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,纸真挺括\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice stationery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西米亚信笺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bohemian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,捷克出产的 没有指纹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the Czech Republic. No fingerprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位女士用了自来水笔 派克世纪铱金笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used a fountain pen. Parker Duofold, iridium nib.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女士？- 显然嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She? - Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这…是那个手机 粉红手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that… That's the phone. The pink phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「粉色的研究」里的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, from The Study In Pink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然不是同一个 但故意用同款…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, it's not the same phone, but it's supposed to look like…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「粉色的研究」？你也看他的博客？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Study In Pink"? You read his blog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们都爱看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不知道地球绕太阳转？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you REALLY not know that the Earth goes round the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是同一只手机 这个是全新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't the same phone. This one's brand-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人故意选了同样的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's taken trouble to make it look the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你的博客读者群还挺广\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means your blog has a far wider readership.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「您有一条新短信」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这些？- 不 不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was that it? - No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是跟我们搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we supposed to make of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张房产广告照 该死的格林威治报时信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}An estate agent's photo and the bloody Greenwich pips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是个警告 - 警告？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a warning. - A warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些秘密社团寄送晒干的西瓜籽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some secret societies used to send dried melon seeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,桔核之类的东西 信号（又意桔核）有五响\N{\fnArial\fs30}orange pips, things like that, five pips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们警告我们这还会再发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're warning us it's going to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我见过这个地方 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've seen this place before. - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么会再发生？- 轰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going to happen again? - Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过一眼 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a look, didn't you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:14:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次来看房的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you first came to see about your flat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,门最近开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door's been opened, recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 只有这一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, can't be. That's the only key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到人想租这间房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get anyone interested in this flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太潮湿了吧 地下室就这毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the damp, I expect that's the curse of basements.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚结婚的时候住过 满墙的青苔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd a place once when I was first married. Mould all up the wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Dear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是投弹手 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bomber, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:58.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来电号码屏蔽）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…好 性感帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-Hello…sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你…准备了个…小谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've…sent you…a little puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是问个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你哭什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's talking? Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我没有哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在打字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…蠢婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this…stupid bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在替我读\N{\fnArial\fs30}is reading it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大幕拉开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The curtain rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一天我等了一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been expecting this for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,12小时…解开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 hours to solve…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的谜语…夏洛克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my puzzle, Sherlock…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm going to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会…捣蛋的哟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so…naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:25.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴兹医学院）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你觉得是谁？- 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, who do you suppose it was? - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话里的 在哭的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman on the phone, the crying woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不重要 她只是个人质 没线索的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she doesn't matter, she's just a hostage. No lead there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't thinking about leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to be much use to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在追踪吗 追踪手机信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they trying to trace it, trace the call?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹手太聪明了 没用的 我的手机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bomber's too smart for that. Pass my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪？- 上衣兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - Jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text from your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 删掉 - 删掉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Delete it. - Delete it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划已经流出国外了 我们没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans are out of the country. Nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（韦斯特之死有进展否？—麦克罗夫特）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克罗夫特认为我们有 他发给你八条短信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mycroft thinks there is. He's texted you eight times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他怎么还有空看牙医？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why didn't he cancel his dental appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要能说话 绝不发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft never texts if he can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁·韦斯特偷了计划去卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Andrew West stole the missile plans, tried to sell them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果送掉了脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}got his head smashed in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一疑点是我哥干嘛缠着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only mystery is why my brother is so determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰我和这么有趣的人交锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bore me when somebody is being so interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托记住有个女人快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and remember there's a woman who might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？医院里随时都有人死去 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for? There's hospitals full of people dying, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不去他们床边哭哭看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go and cry by their bedside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能给他们吊命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see what good it does them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:03.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜索完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有发现吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any luck? - Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 嗨 快进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, hi! Come in! Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆 这就是夏洛克·福尔摩斯 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jim, this is Sherlock Holmes. - Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…抱歉你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, er… Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·华生 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你就是夏洛克·福尔摩斯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. So you're Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉给我讲了好多你的事 你在办案吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly's told me all about you. You on one of your cases?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆在楼上IT部工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim works in IT, upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这么认识的 办公室恋情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we met. Office romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 什么？- 没什么 呃…嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, what? - Nothing. Um, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd better be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,狐狸剧院见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you at the Fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六点钟？- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About sixish? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么同性恋？我们在交往耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, gay? We're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,居家生活一定很适合你 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domestic bliss must suit you, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天没见你胖了三磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've put on 3lb since I last saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两磅半 - 不 三磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two-and-a-half. - No, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 他不是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock. - He's not gay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何苦非要毁掉…他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to spoil…? He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么爱打扮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With that level of grooming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他头发上抹东西吗 我也抹的呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he puts product in his hair? I put product in my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你洗头发时抹 不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wash your hair, there's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,染睫毛 额头上有牛磺酸精华霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tinted eyelashes, signs of taurine cream around the frown lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,泡夜店泡到满眼血丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}those tired, clubber's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有他的内裤 - 他的内裤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then there's his underwear. - His underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰上露出一截 非常特别的品牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visible above the waistline. Very particular brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最明显的是 他在碟子底下留了个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus the suggestive fact that he left his number under this dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你尽早分手 免得事后伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you'd better break it off now and save yourself the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 干的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming, well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为她节省时间 不是很好心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saving her time. Isn't that kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好心？不不 夏洛克 这不是好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinder? No, no, Sherlock, that wasn't kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么做 试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I do. Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是算了 - 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh… No. - Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会站在这 由着你笑话我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to let you humiliate me while I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,旁观者清\N{\fnArial\fs30}An outside eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同的意见 对我很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}a second opinion, it's very useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对哦 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, right! - Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只是双鞋…跑鞋 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, they're just a pair of sh…trainers. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,状态很好 我觉得还挺新\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in good nick. I'd say they were pretty new,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有鞋底有磨损\N{\fnArial\fs30}except the sole has been well worn,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它的主人已经穿了一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the owner must have had them for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,八十年代风格 大概是复古款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, very '80s. Probably one of those retro designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成就惊人啊 还有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on sparkling form. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,码子很大 是男人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're quite big. A man's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是内侧有写名字的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's traces of a name inside in felt-tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,成人不会在鞋上签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adults don't write their names inside their shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是小孩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so these belong to a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 还有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这些 - 就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做的怎样？- 很好 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did I do? - Well, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你几乎漏掉了所有重要信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you missed almost everything of importance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人爱惜它 擦得很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}The owner loved these. Scrubbed them clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还上了油 鞋带换了三…不 四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whitened them. Changed the laces three…no, four times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,手指触摸的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are traces of flaky skin where his fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有皮屑 所以他患了湿疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}have come into contact with them, so he had eczema.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,内侧比外侧磨损严重 他足弓无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shoes are more worn on the inner side, so he had weak arches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国制造的 20年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}British-made, 20 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 20年？- 不是复古款 是原装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 20 years? - They're not retro, they're original.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,限量版 两条蓝道 1989年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Limited edition, two blue stripes, 1989.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面还沾着泥 看起来很新\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still mud on them. They look new.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人特意保存的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's kept them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋掌沾了好几层泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a bit of mud caked on the soles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.37,0:21:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,化验出内层是苏塞克斯郡的 外层是伦敦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Analysis shows it's from Sussex with London mud overlaying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 花粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - Pollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,清晰得像地图 泰晤士南岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear as a map reference. South of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子20年前从苏塞克斯来伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kid came to London from Sussex 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下了跑鞋 - 他出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And left the trainers behind. - What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.61,0:21:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱这双鞋 记得吗 绝不容许它弄脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved those shoes, remember. He'd never leave them filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:22:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到万不得已 不会抛弃它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't let them go unless he had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 一个大脚小孩来到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a child with big feet gets…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.83,0:22:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·鲍华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 谁？- 卡尔·鲍华 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, who? - Carl Powers, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的起点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where I began.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,1989年 小孩 游泳健将 从布列顿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}1989, kid, champion swimmer, came from Brighton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加运动会 淹死在泳池里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a school sports tournament, drowned in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一场悲剧 你不会记得的 - 可你记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tragic accident. You wouldn't remember it. - But you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.61,0:22:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 事有蹊跷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Something fishy about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.67,0:22:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我 我当时也是小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody except me. I was only a kid myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在报纸上读到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read about it in the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你起步还挺早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started young, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男孩 卡尔·鲍华\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy, Carl Powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水中突然抽筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}had some kind of fit in the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.19,0:22:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可等他们救他出来 已经迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by the time they got him out, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事不对劲 我脑海里一直盘桓着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something wrong somewhere. I couldn't get it out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他的鞋 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - His shoes. - What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了 我大闹一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't there. I made a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力想让警方注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to get the police interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:23:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可根本没人重视\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nobody seemed to think it was important.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它衣服都在更衣室柜子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd left all the rest of his clothes in his locker,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有鞋不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was no sign of his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.55,0:23:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.51,0:23:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮助你 只剩五小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help. There's only five hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:49.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有进展吗？—麦克罗夫特）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.55,0:23:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他发给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's texting me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么有我的号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he know my number?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:23:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他牙齿准是根管治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a root canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:24:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 他说这是国家大事 - 哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, he did say…national importance. - Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真古板 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How quaint! - What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.83,0:24:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呀 忠君爱国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are. Queen and country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.45,0:24:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能视而不见啊 - 我没有视而不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't just ignore it. - I'm not ignoring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.60,0:24:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就派我最出色的人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting my best man onto it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.77,0:24:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 真荣幸 我就说马上会再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, how nice! I was hoping it wouldn't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.90,0:24:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能效劳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.48,0:24:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I was wanting to…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.15,0:24:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟派我来收集些情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother sent me to collect more facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.21,0:24:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于被盗的计划 反导弹计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the stolen plans, the missile plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.41,0:24:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是的 他正在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he? - Yes. He's investigating now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.45,0:24:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在… 全力调查中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, er…investigating away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.91,0:24:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问问 关于死者你还能告诉我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wondered what else you could tell me about the dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.51,0:24:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,27岁 在沃克斯豪尔当书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, 27. Clerk at Vauxhall Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.62,0:24:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,军情六处\N{\fnArial\fs30}MI6.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在布鲁斯-帕廷顿计划中微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was involved in the Bruce-Partington Program in a minor capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.77,0:24:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲级保安检查 通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security checks A-OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.82,0:25:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,未发现恐怖主义联系或倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}No known terrorist affiliations or sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.09,0:25:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后见的是他未婚妻 昨晚十点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last seen by his fiancee 10.30 yesterday evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.37,0:25:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西亲爱的 我得出去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, love, I've got to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to see someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小韦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.36,0:25:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,陈尸在巴特西 对 所以他乘了火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was found at Battersea, yes. So he got on the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.65,0:25:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.61,0:25:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带着交通卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had an Oyster card…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但没刷过 - 他一定是买的票\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but it hadn't been used. - He must have bought a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.10,0:25:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体上没有车票\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no ticket on the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.36,0:25:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他怎么会脑浆迸裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then… How did he end up with a bashed-in brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.45,0:25:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在巴特西铁轨上的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the tracks at Battersea?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the question…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.44,0:25:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望夏洛克能解答的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one I was rather hoping Sherlock would provide an answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.77,0:25:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进展怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he getting on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.14,0:25:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 案子进展… 非常顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is going…very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.01,0:25:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 呃… 全神贯注在这上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, um… He's completely focused on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.70,0:26:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毒药 - 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Poison! - What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.71,0:26:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉毒杆菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clostridium botulinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.84,0:26:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上最猛的毒药之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the deadliest poisons on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·鲍华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.28,0:26:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，等下 你是说 他是被谋杀的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. Are you saying he was murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.98,0:26:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得鞋带吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember the shoelaces? - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.31,0:26:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有湿疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He suffered from eczema.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.54,0:26:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易把毒下到他药里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be easy to introduce the poison into his medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.08,0:26:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时后他来到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hours later he comes to London,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.89,0:26:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒药麻痹肌肉 他淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the poison paralyses the muscles and he drowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,验尸怎么没验出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come the autopsy didn't pick that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.71,0:26:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无法检验 没人想到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's virtually undetectable. Nobody was looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.98,0:26:33.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已解决 跑鞋属于卡尔·鲍华）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.32,0:26:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋上还有微量的残留\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still tiny traces of it in the trainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.98,0:26:37.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有肉毒杆菌残留 贝克街221B）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.48,0:26:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往脚上擦药膏时留的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where he put the cream on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.32,0:26:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此才要藏起鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.53,0:26:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么通知投弹手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we let the bomber know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.52,0:26:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,引起他注意 让计时停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get his attention, stop the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.08,0:26:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凶手把鞋藏了这么多年 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The killer kept the shoes all these years. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.57,0:26:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可见… - 他就是投弹手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meaning… - He's our bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.61,0:27:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well done, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.75,0:27:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来救我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Come and get me."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.43,0:27:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.04,0:27:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.46,0:27:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她家住康沃尔郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives in Cornwall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.38,0:27:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个蒙面人闯入 逼她开车到停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men broke in wearing masks, forced her to drive to the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.88,0:27:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在那 身上装了能炸平一座房子的炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}and decked her out in enough explosives to take down a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.04,0:27:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他打电话给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her to phone you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.94,0:27:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,念这寻呼机上面的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the read-out from this pager.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.03,0:27:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要念错一个字 狙击手就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she deviated by one word, the sniper would set her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者只要你没破案 - 哦 真优雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or if you hadn't solved the case. - Oh…elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.93,0:27:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,优雅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elegant?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.09,0:27:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,何苦费这周折？怎么会有人想这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the point? Why would anyone do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.85,0:27:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 全世界总不止我一个人无聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…I can't be the only person in the world that gets bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.52,0:27:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「您有一条新短信」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.10,0:28:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,四响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four pips.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子第一项考验通过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First test passed, it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.09,0:28:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第二项\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.54,0:28:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,被扔掉的报废车 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's abandoned, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.83,0:28:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看有没有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see if it's been reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎 找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找警察了 这也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK that you've gone to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.74,0:28:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.40,0:28:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是别指望他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't rely on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.16,0:28:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜到了卡尔·鲍尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}guessing about Carl Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never liked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔嘲笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl laughed at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我让他再也不能笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I stopped him laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.05,0:28:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看 你又偷了一个人的声音吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've stolen another voice, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.71,0:28:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你和我两个人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.10,0:29:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？那是什么噪音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.40,0:29:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生命的声音啊 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the sounds of life, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.84,0:29:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别担心 我马上就能解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry. I can soon fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你九小时内解出了我上个谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You solved my last puzzle in nine hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次给你八小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time you have eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.12,0:29:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.86,0:29:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,车是昨天早上租的 顾客叫伊安·蒙克福\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car was hired yesterday morning by an Ian Monkford.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.68,0:29:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在银行工作 城市青年 现金支付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banker of some kind. City boy. Paid in cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟妻子说去出差 但是一直没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told his wife he was going away on a business trip, never arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.76,0:30:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还在围着他转 - 呃 是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're still hanging round him. - Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.75,0:30:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是两极相吸吧 - 我们不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Opposites attract, I s'pose. - We're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得找点兴趣爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get yourself a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,集邮 火车模型什么的 安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamps, maybe. Model trains. Safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.20,0:30:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先告诉你声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.90,0:30:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那确实是蒙克福的血 验过DNA了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, it's Monkford's blood.DNA checks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没尸体 - 暂时没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No body. - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.20,0:30:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把血样送到实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a sample sent to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.10,0:30:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙克福夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Monkford…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.20,0:30:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 抱歉 有两个警官问询过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Sorry, but I've already spoken with two policemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.00,0:30:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是警方 我们是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not from the police, we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.60,0:30:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 您先生的旧友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock HolmesVery old friend of your husband's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.30,0:30:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 可以说是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.80,0:30:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 哪位？我不记得他提到过您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Who? I don't think he ever mentioned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.50,0:30:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦他肯定说过的 这事儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he must have done. This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直让人伤心欲绝 难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is horrible.I mean, I just can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.50,0:30:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前两天才刚见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only saw him the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.00,0:30:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是老样子 无忧无虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old Ian.Not a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我丈夫抑郁好几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry… My husband has been depressed for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.30,0:30:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.00,0:31:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,租车的行为很奇怪 他为什么要这么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really strange that he hired a car.Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点可疑啊 您不觉得么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit suspicious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.60,0:31:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没觉得 他忘了续交私车的税而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't. He forgot to renew the tax on the car, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此 果然是伊安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well! That was Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.40,0:31:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊安以前总这副德行 - 伊安从没这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was Ian all over. - No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.80,0:31:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前不是么 有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't it? Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那人是谁？- 你为什么要骗她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was that? - Why did you lie to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.60,0:31:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,人不爱主动说出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't like telling you things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们总喜欢反驳 过去时 注意到了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they love to contradict you.Past tense, did you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我以谈论死人的方式 用的过去时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I referred to her husband in the past tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She joined in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.40,0:31:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真武断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit premature.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.90,0:31:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方才刚刚发现车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've only just found the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.30,0:31:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她谋杀亲夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she murdered her husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.90,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谋杀犯不会蠢到犯这种错 - 懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not a mistake a murderer would make. - I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.90,0:31:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 还是不懂 应该怎样？- 钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. What am I seeing? - Fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.10,0:31:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试试钓鱼 - 现在去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try fishing. - Where now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.50,0:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰纳斯租车行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janus Cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.20,0:31:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在仪表板下的储物箱里发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just found this in the glove compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.90,0:31:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我帮不上忙啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't see how I can help you gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.90,0:31:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙克福先生昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Monkford hired the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在贵公司租了辆车 - 是 很赞的型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- from you yesterday. - Yeah, lovely motor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.80,0:32:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马自达 RX8 我本人也很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mazda RX8.Wouldn't mind one of them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.10,0:32:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那种？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.20,0:32:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那些都是捷豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're all Jags.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.90,0:32:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你并不是爱车一族？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you're not a car man, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.20,0:32:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你肯定买得起一辆马自达\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely you can afford one, a Mazda, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.10,0:32:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.40,0:32:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在糖果店工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like working in a sweet shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.40,0:32:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝过甘草什锦糖 就会一发不可收拾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you start eating the Liquorice Allsorts, where does it stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.50,0:32:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识蒙克福先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know Mr Monkford.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是客户而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he was just a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.40,0:32:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨天来的 从我这儿租走辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came in here and hired one of my cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他的事我毫不知情 可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've no idea what happened to him.Poor sod!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.70,0:32:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 假期可好 伊华德先生？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice holiday, Mr Ewart? - Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.90,0:32:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 近期出国过吧？- 哦 是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been away, haven't you? - Oh, the…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是日光浴床晒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's sun beds, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.40,0:32:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作太忙了走不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too busy to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.70,0:32:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我老婆会喜欢 海滨晒太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife would love it, though bit of sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有零钱么 自动售货机买烟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got any change for the cigarette machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.10,0:32:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.60,0:32:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来时看到有 烟瘾上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed one on the way in and I'm gasping.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢 伊华德先生 打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well! Thank you very much for your time, Mr Ewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.90,0:32:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可帮了我们大忙 约翰 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been very helpful. Come on, John!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.50,0:32:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有零钱 如果你想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got change, if you still want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.90,0:33:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼古丁贴片 记得吧 我戒烟顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicotine patches, remember? I'm doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你刚才是要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.70,0:33:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看看他的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to look inside his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.70,0:33:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛 - 伊华德先生是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Mr Ewart's a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:38.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来电号码屏蔽）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.20,0:33:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,线索在名字中 杰纳斯租车行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clue's in the name, Janus Cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.90,0:33:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么突然好心来提示我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you be giving me a clue?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.80,0:33:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事皆有理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does anyone do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.20,0:33:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我无聊嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.60,0:33:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们注定互相牵绊 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were made for each other, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.00,0:34:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你自己打电话给我 - 耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then talk to me in your own voice. - Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.10,0:34:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说驾驶座上的血有多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood was on that seat, would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少？大约一品脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much? About a pint.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.20,0:34:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是大约 正好一品脱 他们犯的第一个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not about. Exactly a pint.That was their first mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.30,0:34:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这血确实属于伊安 但是冷冻血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood's Ian Monkford's, but it's been frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.20,0:34:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷冻血？- 有明显的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frozen? - There are clear signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.00,0:34:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为伊安·蒙克福之前抽了一品脱血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Ian Monkford gav a pint of his blood some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.80,0:34:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后他们洒在这里 - 谁干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's what they spread on the seat. - Who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.90,0:34:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰纳斯租车行 线索就在名字里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janus Cars. The clue's in the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.70,0:34:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗马神话的两面天门神？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The god with two faces? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.10,0:34:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们提供特殊服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}They provide a very special service.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是委托人有任何麻烦 债务\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've got any kind of a problem, money troubles,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.70,0:34:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚变 无论什么 杰纳斯帮你消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}bad marriage, whatever, Janus Cars will help you disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.70,0:35:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙克福有麻烦 估计是财务问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian Monkford was in trouble, financial at a guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.70,0:35:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在银行工作嘛 他走投无路\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's a banker, couldn't see a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.80,0:35:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他人间蒸发\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he were to vanish,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他租的车沾满他的血被发现…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the car he hired was found with his blood on the driver's seat…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.70,0:35:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那他人到底在哪 - 哥伦比亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So where is he? - Colombia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.70,0:35:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colombia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.10,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰纳斯车行的伊华德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ewart, of Janus Cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱包里有一张两万哥伦比亚比索\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a 20, 000 Colombian peso note in his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.10,0:35:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及不少比索零钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a bit of change, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.50,0:35:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他说最近没有出国过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told us he hadn't been abroad recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.40,0:35:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我问他车型时\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when I asked him about the cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.00,0:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他颈上晒痕清晰可见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see his tan line clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人穿衬衫去照日光浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one wears a shirt on a sun bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.10,0:35:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有他的手臂 - 他的手臂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That, plus his arm. - His arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.90,0:35:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不断在挠 显然很痒 而且在渗血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept scratching it. Obviously irritating him, and bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.00,0:35:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚打过疫苗 可能是乙肝疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd recently had a booster jab.Hep-B, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.60,0:35:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离太远 不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to tell at that distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.10,0:35:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,结论 他安排好伊安·蒙克福\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just back from settling Ian Monkfod.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哥伦比亚的新生活刚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}into his new life in Colombia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.10,0:35:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙克福夫人领保险金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Monkford cashes in the life insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和杰纳斯车行分赃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she splits it with Janus Cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.20,0:35:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒙克福夫人？- 是的 她也是共犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mrs Monkford? - Oh, yes. She's in on it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.90,0:35:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去逮捕吧 探长 你最擅长这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and arrest them, Inspector, that's what you do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.30,0:35:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得让投弹人知道案子解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to let our bomber know the case is solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是斗志昂扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.61,0:36:06.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊安·蒙克福搬去哥伦比亚了 贺乔迁之喜）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.70,0:36:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.40,0:36:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以来救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can come and fetch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.20,0:36:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.70,0:36:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 求你们救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.20,0:36:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好点了么 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feeling better? - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.30,0:36:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事开始后 喘气的机会都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've hardly stopped for breath since this thing started.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.50,0:36:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想过没… - 大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has it occurred to you…? - Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说你想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, has it occurred to you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.30,0:36:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这投弹人是在跟你玩智力游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bomber's playing a game with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.70,0:36:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,信封 闯进别人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The envelope, breaking into the other flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去世小孩的鞋 都是给你出的题 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the dead kid's shoes, it's all meant for you. - Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.00,0:37:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他么 莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it him, then? Moriarty?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.90,0:37:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可能是随便什么人 - 可能 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That could be anybody. - It could be, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.40,0:37:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你走运 有我待业在家闲得发霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you, I've been more than a little unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.50,0:37:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How d'you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.00,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和赫德森太太看太多电视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you, Mrs Hudson and I watch far too much telly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 泰拉 大家看\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Thank you, Tyra!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.90,0:37:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在是不是靓丽可人了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't she look lovely, everybody, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.50,0:37:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 说到丝质手袋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…speaking of silk purses…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.80,0:37:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.20,0:37:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的目标…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.40,0:37:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a bit…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.00,0:37:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,残障\N{\fnArial\fs30}…defective.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.20,0:37:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.60,0:37:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个瞎子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.40,0:37:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.30,0:37:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.80,0:37:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}…12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.30,0:38:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.20,0:38:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.40,0:38:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在暗处看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to watch you…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.10,0:38:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,翩翩起舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.40,0:38:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现你又重拾恶习了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…And I see you're back to your bad habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.00,0:38:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Continuing into.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.10,0:38:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视界名人康妮·普林斯猝死\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sudden death of the popular TV personality Connie Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.20,0:38:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「美丽俏佳人」主持普林斯女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Prince, famous for her makeover programmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.30,0:38:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前被发现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}was found dead two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.60,0:38:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其弟合住的房子里死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}by her brother in the house they shared…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.80,0:38:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮·普林斯 54岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie Prince, 54.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.40,0:38:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是电视上一个美容节目的主持人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had one of those makeover shows on the telly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.80,0:38:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看过么 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.20,0:38:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常红 前景光明 - 都灰飞烟灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very popular. She was going places. - Not any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.30,0:38:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.30,0:38:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的员工劳尔·德·桑托斯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to one of her staff, Raoul de Santos,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.10,0:39:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被园子里一根锈钉子扎伤了手 伤得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}she cut her hand on a rusty nail in the garden. Nasty wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.00,0:39:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,破伤风病菌进入血液循环 双眼一闭两腿一蹬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tetanus bacteria enters the bloodstream, good night, Vienna.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.00,0:39:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I s'pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.60,0:39:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这有点说不通 - 哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something's wrong with this picture. - Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.70,0:39:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be that simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.80,0:39:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则投弹人不会让我们来查这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise the bomber wouldn't be directing us towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.80,0:39:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有不对的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.00,0:39:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John? - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.50,0:39:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她手上的伤口非常深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut on her hand, it's deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.30,0:39:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会大量出血 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have bled a lot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.20,0:39:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 但伤口周围很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - But the wound's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.20,0:39:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很干净 也很新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very clean, and fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.50,0:39:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,病菌在她体内繁殖了多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long would the bacteria have been incubating inside her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.70,0:39:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,八到十天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, eight, ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.10,0:40:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口是事后出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cut was made later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.50,0:40:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在她死后？- 基本可以肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After she was dead? - Must have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.00,0:40:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.10,0:40:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒怎么进入死人体内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did the tetanus enter the dead woman's system?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.30,0:40:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过想帮我吧 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to help, right? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.40,0:40:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮·普林斯的背景 家族史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie Prince's background, family history,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切的一切 都收集来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- everything, get me data. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.50,0:40:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有件事没考虑到 - 有么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's something else that we haven't thought of. - Is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.80,0:40:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 投弹人为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Why is he doing this the bomber?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.40,0:40:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算她死得可疑 为什么要提醒我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this woman's death was suspicious, why point it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.30,0:40:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,人性本善呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Samaritan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.20,0:40:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还逼人自爆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who press-gangs suicide bombers?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.50,0:40:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,人性本恶呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Samaritan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没跟你开玩笑 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…I'm serious, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.30,0:40:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我由着你随心去调查 我信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm cutting you slack here, I'm trusting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.80,0:40:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但某处有个可怜人正浑身裹着炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}but out there somewhere, some poor bastard's covered in Semtex.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.10,0:40:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你解开谜题救他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's just waiting for you to solve the puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.70,0:40:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 请告诉我 我们到底在对付什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so just tell me, what are we dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.10,0:40:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,前无古人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:41:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,关联 关联 关联 肯定有关联存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connection, connection, connection. There must be a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.20,0:41:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·鲍华 二十年前被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl Powers, killed 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.70,0:41:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹人承认认识这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomber knew him, admitted that he knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.70,0:41:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的手机装在捷克产的信封里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomber's iPhone was in the stationery from the Czech Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.60,0:41:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个人质来自康沃尔 第二个伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first hostage from Cornwall, the second from London,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.40,0:41:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个听口音是约克夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}the third from Yorkshire, judging by her accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干什么 炫耀他的足迹遍布世界各地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing? Working his way round the world, showing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.60,0:41:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你很享受这一切嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're enjoying this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.70,0:41:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,连点成线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joining the…dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.10,0:41:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就炸上天咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom…boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤心欲绝 真的是伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're devastated, of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.80,0:42:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点什么 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, no. No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.80,0:42:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳尔是我的救星 没了他我真不知该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raoul is my rock. I don't think I could have managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.90,0:42:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有过些小摩擦 但姐姐跟我还是很亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't always see eye to eye…but my sister was very dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.60,0:42:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对于公众呢 普林斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to the, er, public, Mr Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.70,0:42:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她相当受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she was adored.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼见过长得像公交车屁股的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen her take girls who looked like the back end of Routemasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.40,0:42:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过她的打造变成公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn them into princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.30,0:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我很欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it's a relief, in a way,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.60,0:42:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道她脱离了红尘苦海 往生极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know that she's beyond this vale of tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.00,0:42:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.40,0:42:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.00,0:42:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.40,0:42:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 我真的很喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a real shame. I liked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.10,0:42:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她教人怎么配色\N{\fnArial\fs30}She taught you how to do your colours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.20,0:42:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 配色？- 色彩搭配一类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Colours? - You know, what goes best with what.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.50,0:42:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然我不适合穿樱桃红的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never wear cerise, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.00,0:42:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 衬得我很苍白 - 那是谁的电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drains me. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.60,0:42:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 内政部 - 内政部？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Home Office. - Home Office?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.20,0:42:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实是内政部长 欠我个人情 - 是个美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, Home Secretary, actually. Owes me a favour. - A pretty girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.40,0:43:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她喜欢折腾自己的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she messed about with herself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.80,0:43:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明星都打肉毒杆菌 他们脸都僵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all do these days.People can hardly move their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.50,0:43:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太愚蠢了 不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's silly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.00,0:43:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看过她的节目么？- 这就看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you ever see her show? - Not until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.90,0:43:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你看起来好苍白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pasty, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.60,0:43:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老下雨 只有一天不下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, rained every day but one…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.90,0:43:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她弟弟 毫不伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the brother.No love lost there,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 八卦报纸上说的 - 我也听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if you can believe the papers. - So I gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.30,0:43:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才跟节目粉丝们聊了聊 收获颇丰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just had a fruitful chat with people who love this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.50,0:43:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉丝站是八卦的不二来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fan site's indispensable for gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.60,0:43:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们同意吧 姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Don't you think, girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.10,0:43:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去 下去 下去 下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off, off, off, off, off, off, off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.50,0:43:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们想不到有这么多时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more common than people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.10,0:43:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,破伤风藏在土壤里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tetanus is in the soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.70,0:43:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被玫瑰花刺 园丁剪割伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}people cut themselves on rose bushes, garden forks,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.10,0:43:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸如此类 如果延误了治疗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sort of thing, and if left un…treated…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.20,0:43:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道该怎么办了 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what I'm going to do now. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.30,0:43:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把这房子留给了我 这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's left me this place…which is lovely…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.60,0:44:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有她就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it's not the same without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.20,0:44:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.30,0:44:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们报纸想听你\N{\fnArial\fs30}my paper wanted to get the,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.90,0:44:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲口说说这整个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}um…the full story straight from the horse's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.80,0:44:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不会太冒失吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it's not too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.00,0:44:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.10,0:44:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管问\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fire away.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.90,0:44:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 喂 快过来 我有新发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Hi. Look, get over here quickly. I think I'm onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.90,0:44:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上要买点儿东西 手边有笔么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need to pick up some stuff first. Got a pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.60,0:44:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.40,0:44:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他了 - 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That'll be him. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.20,0:44:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您是普林斯先生吧 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, Mr Prince, isn't it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very good to meet you. - Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.00,0:44:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请节哀顺变 - 多谢您关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So sorry to hear about… - Yes, yes, very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.20,0:44:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we, er…?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.80,0:44:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 病菌从别的途径进入她体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, the bacteria got into her another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.30,0:44:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是么？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yes? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.30,0:44:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, are we all set?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.30,0:44:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, yes. Shall we, um…?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拍太近 拍哭我不在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too close. I'm raw from crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.50,0:44:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦 这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.40,0:45:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞克荷迈特 以埃及女神命名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sekhmet. Named after the Egyptian goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.50,0:45:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真典雅 康妮养的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How nice. Was she Connie's?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.30,0:45:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 鄙人送她的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, a little present from yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.30,0:45:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 检测下色度吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, light reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.90,0:45:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 2.8 该死 搞什么鬼？- 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 2.8. Bloody hell!What are you playing at? - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.10,0:45:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么像说相声一样 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like Laurel and bloody Hardy, you two! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.20,0:45:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经完工了 失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got what we came for.Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.20,0:45:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 夏洛克 干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Sherlock. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.00,0:45:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 赶发稿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got deadlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.30,0:45:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们什么都没拍哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've not taken anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.40,0:45:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Ooh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.10,0:45:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是猫？才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it was the cat.It wasn't the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.40,0:45:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？就是 肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Yes. Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.10,0:45:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是这样染上病毒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be. It's how he got the tetanus into her system.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.50,0:45:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它爪子上有消毒水味 - 想法很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Its paws stink of disinfectant. - Lovely idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.30,0:45:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他涂到猫脚趾上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he coated it onto the claws of her cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.70,0:45:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫刚来没几天 肯定跟她不亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a new pet, bound to be a bit jumpy around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.60,0:45:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓伤根本难以避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scratch is almost inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.70,0:45:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到她手臂上的伤我就想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought of it when I saw the scratches on her arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.00,0:45:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这几率太低\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's too random.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.80,0:45:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她弟弟也想不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and clever for the brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.10,0:45:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为了遗产谋杀了她 - 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He murdered his sister for her money. - Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.00,0:45:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.70,0:45:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. It was revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.50,0:46:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 复仇 谁要复仇？- 劳尔 那个男仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rev…? Who wanted revenge? - Raoul, the houseboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.90,0:46:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼是他姐姐调笑的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenny Prince was the bu of his sister's jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.70,0:46:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是家暴 最后他忍无可忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virtual bullying campaign. Finally, he had enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.60,0:46:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她决裂了 网上到处写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}fell out with her badly. It's all on the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.90,0:46:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她威胁要取消他的继承权\N{\fnArial\fs30}She threatened to disinherit Kenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.40,0:46:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但劳尔已经习惯了这种生活 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Raoul had grown accustomed to a certain lifestyle… - Wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.20,0:46:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 猫爪子上的消毒水怎么解释呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. What about the disinfectant on the cat's claws?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.60,0:46:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳尔有洁癖 你从厨房门进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raoul keeps a very clean house.You came through the kitchen door,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.90,0:46:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看见地板了 光可鉴人\N{\fnArial\fs30}saw the state of that floor scrubbed within an inch of its life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.80,0:46:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消毒水味的是你自己 猫是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell of disinfectant. No, the cat doesn't come into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过劳尔的网络记录就不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raoul's internet records do, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.40,0:46:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望在这能叫到车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we can get a cab from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.80,0:46:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手是劳尔·德·桑托斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raoul de Santos is your killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.10,0:46:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼·普林斯的男仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenny Prince's houseboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.80,0:46:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次尸检发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second autopsy shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.10,0:46:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮·普林斯并非死于破伤风\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wasn't tetanus that poisoned Connie Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是A型肉毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was botulinum toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.30,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是这样 卡尔·鲍华 啧啧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here beforeCarl Powers. Tut-tut.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.00,0:46:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹人在重蹈覆辙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our bomber's repeated himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.60,0:46:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how'd he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.40,0:46:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注射肉毒杆菌 - 肉毒杆菌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Botox injection. - Botox?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.20,0:46:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉毒杆菌是稀释的肉毒毒 除了家务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Botox is a diluted form of botulinum. Among other things,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.30,0:46:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳尔·德·桑托斯的工作还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raoul de Santos was employed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.70,0:47:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给康妮做面部注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}give Connie her regular facial injections.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.00,0:47:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我内政部的内线给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My contact at the Home Office gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.50,0:47:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳尔的网购记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}the complete records of Raoul's internet purchases.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.40,0:47:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大量订购肉毒杆菌好几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been bulk-ordering Botox for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.90,0:47:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,积累了一段时间 足够致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bided his time, then upped the strength to a fatal dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.70,0:47:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure about this? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 到我办公室来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 多久了？- 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Sherlock, how long? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.90,0:47:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想到多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.10,0:47:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次其实很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this one was quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.00,0:47:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹人重蹈覆辙了 一个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the bomber repeated himself.That was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.40,0:47:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是夏洛克 人质 那位老妇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but Sherlock, the hostage, the old woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.60,0:47:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还绑着炸弹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's been there all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.70,0:47:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定我能救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I could save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.70,0:47:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道我们有十二小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also knew that the bomber had given us 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.10,0:47:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我尽快解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I solved the case quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.40,0:47:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就有时间去查别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that gave me time to get on with other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.70,0:47:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不懂？这次我们领先了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see? We're one up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.30,0:47:45.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（劳尔·德·桑切斯 男仆 肉毒杆菌）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.10,0:47:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.00,0:47:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.10,0:48:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地址 - 他非常的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Address? - He was so…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.70,0:48:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}His voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.80,0:48:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 不要跟我说他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!Tell me nothing about him, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.00,0:48:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的声音非常温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounded so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.70,0:48:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.30,0:48:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.30,0:48:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,此次爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.80,0:48:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,震穿了多层楼面 共十二人身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}which ripped through several floors, killing 12 people…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.10,0:48:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老公寓楼 - 原因是煤气泄漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Old block of flats. - …caused by a faulty gas main.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.30,0:48:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃气公司发言人表示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spokesman from the utility company…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.00,0:48:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真神通广大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He certainly gets about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.10,0:48:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然我输了这一轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously I lost that round.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.10,0:48:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然其实我解决了这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although technically, I did solve the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.00,0:48:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妇人因为透露了他的信息被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed the old lady because she started to describe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.20,0:48:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此一次 他自己上了前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just once, he put himself in the firing line.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.40,0:48:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What d'you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.70,0:49:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常 他从高处统筹一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, usually, he…must stay above it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.90,0:49:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他组织策划 但一般不跟人直接接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}He organises these things, but no-one ever has direct contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说康妮·普林斯的谋杀是他策划的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like the Connie Prince murder he arranged that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.40,0:49:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道人们找他策划谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, people come to him wanting their crimes fixed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.90,0:49:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,像策划度假那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}like booking a holiday?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.50,0:49:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.30,0:49:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这回慢慢来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking his time this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.30,0:49:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·鲍华案有进展么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on the Carl Powers case?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.00,0:49:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.70,0:49:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有在世的同学都查了 没有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the living classmates check out spotless, no connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.00,0:49:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许凶手比卡尔年长？- 我也想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe the killer was older than Carl? - The thought had occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why is he doing this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.50,0:49:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你玩这个智力游戏 难道他想被抓住？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing this game with you.Do you think he wants to be caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.50,0:49:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概他是想打发无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants to be distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.90,0:50:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们俩终成眷属吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you'll be very happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.20,0:50:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 人命关天 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, what? - There are lives at stake, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.10,0:50:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,活生生的生命 我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actual human lives! Just so I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.40,0:50:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是完全不在意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you care about that at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.80,0:50:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在意就能救人命了？- 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will caring about them help save them? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.00,0:50:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会继续避免这种错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll continue not to make that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.80,0:50:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得很容易吧？- 对 简单得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you find that easy, do you? - Yes, very.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.50,0:50:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很吃惊吗？- 不 当然不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that news to you? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.40,0:50:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've disappointed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.80,0:50:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 演绎分析得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, that's a good deduction, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.20,0:50:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把人当成英雄 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make people into heroes, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.70,0:50:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄并不存在 就算真存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heroes don't exist, and if they did,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.10,0:50:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不在其列\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.10,0:50:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.80,0:50:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰晤士河景观\N{\fnArial\fs30}A view of the Thames.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.30,0:50:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,南岸 索斯沃克桥和滑铁卢桥间的某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Bank, somewhere between Southwark Bridge and Waterloo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.50,0:50:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查报纸 我上网看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check the papers, I'll look online.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.30,0:50:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生我气了 不愿意帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're angry with me, so you won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来「在意」也不过如此嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much cop, this caring lark.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.40,0:50:55.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜索 泰晤士： 涨潮 河岸）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.50,0:50:57.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（涨潮期 泰晤士河水质 伦敦大桥）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.70,0:51:03.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（本地新闻 格林威治 滑铁卢 巴特西）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.10,0:51:05.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（滑铁卢 02：16涨潮）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.30,0:51:07.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（04：00警方报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.80,0:51:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳桥自杀 - 不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Archway suicide… - Ten-a-penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.60,0:51:12.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（本地新闻 格林威治 滑铁卢 巴特西）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.80,0:51:14.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴特西 无新讯息）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.50,0:51:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,两儿童在斯托克纽因顿被刺伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two kids stabbed in Stoke Newington.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.60,0:51:19.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（泰晤士警方报告 值班记录）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.30,0:51:21.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（08：00无报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.20,0:51:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车轨道上发现男尸 名为安德鲁·韦斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, man found on the train lineAndrew West.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.60,0:51:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Have you found anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,南岸滑铁卢桥和索斯沃克桥间的新案子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the South Bank between Waterloo Bridge and Southwark Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这跟投弹人有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you reckon this is connected, then, the bomber?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.30,0:51:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有 虽然很奇怪他还没联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be. Odd, though, he hasn't been in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.60,0:52:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又得假定有倒霉蛋被绑上炸弹啰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we must assume that some poor bugger's primed to explode, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有想法么？- 目前为止 有七个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any ideas? - Seven, so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.70,0:52:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.10,0:52:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离他死亡已有二十四小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead about 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.80,0:52:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能再长一些 - 淹死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe a bit longer. - Did he drown?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.95,0:52:44.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国际刑警 通缉犯 犯罪团伙 地方违规）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.21,0:52:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显不是 肺里没什么河水 窒息而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently not. Not enough of the Thames in his lungs. Asphyxiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.00,0:52:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'd agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.80,0:52:48.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（捷克共和国）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.70,0:52:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,口鼻周围有不少淤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's quite a bit of bruising around the nose and mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.80,0:52:54.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（捷克共和国 团伙 通缉）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.70,0:52:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些淤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}More bruises…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.20,0:52:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,分别在这里和这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}here and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.70,0:53:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,指印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.70,0:53:05.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪人口 36小时内 本地）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.80,0:53:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年近四十 处于亚健康状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's late 30s, I'd say, not in the best condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.90,0:53:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体在河里很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been in the river a long while,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.40,0:53:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,水泡掉了大部分信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}the water's destroyed most of the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.30,0:53:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我告诉你们一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.90,0:53:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,新发现的维米尔油画是赝品\N{\fnArial\fs30}that lost Vermeer painting's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.20,0:53:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 得查出被害人身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We need to identify the corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.90,0:53:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他的朋友和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}find out about his friends and…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.00,0:53:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么油画 你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait. What painting? What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.20,0:53:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都传遍了 你没看到海报？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over the place, haven't you seen the posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.00,0:53:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰大师遗作 本以为几世纪前被毁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dutch old master, supposed to have been destroyed centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.70,0:53:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近被发现了 价值三千万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's turned up, worth 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.70,0:53:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那跟案子有何关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so what has that got to do with the stiff?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.40,0:53:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,休戚相关哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.00,0:53:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听说过泥人哥连么 - 泥人哥连？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you ever heard of the Golem? - Golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.80,0:53:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖电影？说这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a horror story, isn't it?What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.00,0:53:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹太民间故事 泥土制成的巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jewish folk story, a gigantic man made of clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.30,0:53:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是个杀手的代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's also the name of an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.00,0:53:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真名奥斯卡·杜斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real name, Oskar Dzundza.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.20,0:53:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界顶级杀手之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the deadliest assassins in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.00,0:53:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的标志性手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is his trademark style.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.00,0:53:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 买凶杀人？- 肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this is a hit? - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.20,0:53:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥人空手把他的目标勒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Golem squeezes the life out of his victims with his bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.20,0:53:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又跟油画有什么关系 我没看出…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what has this got to do with that painting? I don't see…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.80,0:53:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了 只是不会观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do see, you just don't observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.70,0:54:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了别吵了 小姐们 都冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, all right, all right, girls!Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.10,0:54:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 能否劳驾解释一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, do you want to take us through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.60,0:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这具尸体我们都知道点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we know about this corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.90,0:54:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手没留下多少线索 只有裤子和衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer's not left us with much, just the shirt and the trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.20,0:54:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很正式 可能他晚上有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pretty formal, maybe he was going out for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.00,0:54:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,裤子很结实 涤纶的便宜货 衬衫也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trousers are heavy duty.Polyester, nasty, same as the shirt, cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.80,0:54:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他都太大了 应该是统一制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're both too big for him. So some kind of standard-issue uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.80,0:54:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去上班 哪种工作呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dressed for work, then.What kind of work?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.90,0:54:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮带上有个装对讲机的搭扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a hook on his belt…for a walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.70,0:54:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁司机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tube driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.10,0:54:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保安？- 更有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Security guard? - More likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.70,0:54:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 由他的臀部证实了 - 臀部？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That'll be borne out by his backside. - Backside?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.90,0:54:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,臀部松弛 说明他总坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flabby, you'd think he'd led a sedentary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.30,0:54:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他脚掌和腿上的静脉曲张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the soles of his feet and the nascent varicose veins in his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.40,0:54:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,又表明了不同情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}show otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.00,0:54:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常走动也经常坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a lot of walking and a lot of sitting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.30,0:54:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来确实是保安 手表也有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security guard's looking good.The watch helps too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.00,0:54:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹钟显示他常值夜班\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alarm shows he did regular night shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.50,0:54:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他前一天晚上刚设了闹钟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he just set his alarm like that the night before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.80,0:54:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 按钮很硬 说明不常碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. The buttons are stiff, hardly touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.60,0:54:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前设的 生活一成不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}He set his alarm like that a long time ago, his routine never varied.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.20,0:54:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的 杀手可能被打断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something else. The killer must have been interrupted,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.10,0:55:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他肯定把衣服扒光\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise he would have stripped the corpse completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.90,0:55:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,衬衫前胸本来有徽章或标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some kind of badge or insignia on the shirt front.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.90,0:55:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手撕了 说明死者在大公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he tore off, suggesting the dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.30,0:55:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种公共机构工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}some kind of institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他裤子口袋里发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this inside his trouser pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.70,0:55:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,被河水泡了 但还看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sodden by the river, but still recognisably…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.20,0:55:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 票？- 票根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tickets? - Ticket stubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.40,0:55:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在博物馆或画廊工作 经我搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked in a museum or gallery.Did a quick check.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.70,0:55:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克曼画廊报警说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hickman Gallery has reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.70,0:55:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一名员工失踪 亚历克斯·伍德布基\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of its attendants as missing, Alex Woodbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.30,0:55:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 他们要展出新发现的油画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, they unveil the rediscovered masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.60,0:55:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有人要雇佣泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would anyone want to pay the Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.10,0:55:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掐死一个画廊的小小员工呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to suffocate a perfectly ordinary gallery attendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,结论 死者知道内情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inference, the dead man knew something about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.00,0:55:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让画主人赚不到三千万的内情\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that would stop the owner getting paid 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.10,0:55:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那幅画是赝品 - 太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The pictures are fake. - Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.40,0:55:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞小把戏 - 顺祝新年好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meretricious. - And a Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.90,0:55:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor sod.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.30,0:55:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好派探子去打听一下这个泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better get my feelers out for this Golem character.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.70,0:55:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用 你找不到他 但我知道谁能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pointless, you'll never find him, but I know a man who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.10,0:55:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.60,0:56:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么不来电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hasn't he phoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.40,0:56:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他破坏自己的规律 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's broken his pattern. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.70,0:56:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滑铁卢桥 - 现在去哪儿 画廊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Waterloo Bridge. - Where now, the gallery?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.30,0:56:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.30,0:56:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克曼现代画廊 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hickman's contemporary art, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.20,0:56:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们怎么会找到古画呢 - 不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why have they got hold of an old master? - Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.00,0:56:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妄下结论是很危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous to jump to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.10,0:56:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要资讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need data…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.70,0:56:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.80,0:56:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等会好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.60,0:56:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.10,0:56:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.70,0:56:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,零钱 有零钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change? Any change?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.30,0:56:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要干嘛 - 当然是拿去喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What for? - Cup of tea, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.40,0:56:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 50镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.10,0:57:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是干什么？- 投资\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Investing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.80,0:57:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去画廊 你有现金么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we go to the gallery.Have you got any cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.80,0:57:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用来 去查那保安的一切资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I need you to find out all you can about the gallery attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.30,0:57:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷斯垂德会给你地址的 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lestrade will give you the address. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.60,0:57:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们合住了一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd been sharing about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.20,0:57:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,室友而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sharing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.40,0:58:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能看看么？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.50,0:58:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.60,0:58:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢天文啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stargazer, was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.20,0:58:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 爱得如痴如狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, yeah. Mad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.20,0:58:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他唯一的业余爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all he ever did in his spare time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.90,0:58:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿历克斯人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a nice guy, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.40,0:58:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.40,0:58:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was, er…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.70,0:58:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不爱打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}never much of a one for hoovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.40,0:58:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艺术呢 他喜欢艺术么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about art?Did he know anything about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.70,0:58:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是工作 糊口罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a job, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.40,0:58:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有人来打听阿历克斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone else been round asking about Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.90,0:58:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.60,0:58:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒是有人非法闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a break-in, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.60,0:58:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候 - 昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.20,0:58:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.60,0:58:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一条给阿历克斯的电话留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there was a message left for Alex on the land line.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.10,0:59:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁留的？- 你想听我可以放给你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was it from? - I can play it for you, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.00,0:59:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去拿电话 - 麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get the phone. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.90,0:59:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始录音了？阿历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, should I speak now? Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.50,0:59:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我是凯安斯教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love, it's Professor Cairns.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.30,0:59:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你是对的 完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you were right.You were bloody right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.40,0:59:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空给我们回个电…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a call when…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.60,0:59:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯安斯教授？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Cairns?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 抱歉 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No idea, sorry. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.30,0:59:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能回拨么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I try and ring back?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.10,0:59:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行了 我接过好几个慰问电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No good. I've had other calls since.Sympathy ones, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.10,0:59:37.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回复：布鲁斯-帕廷顿计划）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.41,0:59:39.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（和韦斯特未婚妻谈了吗 —麦克罗夫特）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.94,0:59:44.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希克曼画廊）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.20,0:59:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有活要干了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have something to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.50,0:59:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欣赏画作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just admiring the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.50,1:00:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.20,1:00:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,品味不错 快回去工作 今晚有开幕式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely. Now get back to work, we open tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不紧张吗？- 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doesn't it bother you? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.28,1:00:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅画是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the painting's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.84,1:00:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.08,1:00:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它必须是 这是唯一的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be. It's the only possible explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.18,1:00:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿负责 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in charge, aren't you,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.34,1:00:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 温斯莱斯小姐 - 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Wenceslas? - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.80,1:00:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德布基知道它是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex Woodbridge knew that the painting was a fake,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.53,1:00:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以有人派「泥人」来解决他 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so somebody sent the Golem to take care of him. Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.84,1:00:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥人？你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golem? What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.12,1:00:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在为别人工作吗？为他们伪造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you working for someone else? Did you fake it for them?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.21,1:00:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.23,1:00:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是 我也不知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a fake. I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.68,1:00:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会有破绽 一定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something wrong with it, there has to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.37,1:00:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.31,1:00:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在就可以把你开除 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know I could have you sacked on the spot. - Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.43,1:00:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题？- 对 我又不在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No, I don't work here, you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.15,1:00:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是走进来 给你个友好的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just popped in to give you a bit of friendly advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.24,1:00:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.67,1:00:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! - I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.41,1:00:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别人眼皮底下隐藏自己 就是伪装的艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}The art of disguise is knowing how to hide in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.83,1:00:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.17,1:00:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该如雷贯耳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to be impressed?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.17,1:00:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.48,1:00:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您有愉快的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.84,1:01:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't. He just wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.22,1:01:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.82,1:01:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 世上无奇不有 - 小韦不是叛国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stranger things have happened. - Westie wasn't a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.87,1:01:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样说太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a horrible thing to say!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.32,1:01:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 可是你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.But you must understand…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.34,1:01:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这样想 对吧 他的老板？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they think, isn't it, his bosses?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.48,1:01:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是快结婚的年轻人 欠着债\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was young man, about to get married, he had debts.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.15,1:01:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都欠着债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's got debts,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.13,1:01:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小韦绝不可能为了还债 去出卖国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Westie wouldn't want to clear them by selling out his country.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.27,1:01:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我… 那晚究竟发生了什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you, er…? Can you tell me exactly what happened that night?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.00,1:01:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在家呆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were having a night in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.12,1:01:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…看DVD\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…watching a DVD.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.73,1:01:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,平时他会睡着 可这次他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He normally falls asleep, you know, but he sat through this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.46,1:01:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.54,1:01:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然他就说要出去见个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the blue he said he just had to go and see someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.48,1:02:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've no idea who?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.15,1:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 丽兹 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Liz. You OK, love?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.30,1:02:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好 - 他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.43,1:02:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·华生 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson, hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.40,1:02:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我哥哥 乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.14,1:02:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰在调查小韦的事 乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}John's trying to find out what happened to Westie, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.36,1:02:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是警局的人？- 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You with the police? - Sort of, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.69,1:02:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫他们少管闲事 真他妈的岂有此理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to get off their arses, will you? It's bloody ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.28,1:02:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.73,1:02:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, er,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.46,1:02:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次谢谢你的合作 我非常 非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks very much for your help. Again, I'm very, very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有偷那些东西 华生先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't steal those things, Mr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.92,1:02:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解小韦 他是好男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Westie, he was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.36,1:02:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的好男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was MY good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给点零钱吧 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spare change? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.27,1:03:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,给点零钱吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any spare change?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.07,1:03:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾利克斯·伍德布基对艺术毫无专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex Woodbridge didn't know anything special about art.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.24,1:03:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且？- 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - And…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.02,1:03:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没了吗？爱好 个性？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it? No habits, hobbies, personality?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.49,1:03:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抢我话啊 他是业余天文学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a chance. He was an amateur astronomer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.73,1:03:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫住那辆出租\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.29,1:03:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有零钱吗？- 还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spare change, sir? - Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.47,1:03:37.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（沃克斯豪尔拱门）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.12,1:03:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆幸啊 我可没偷懒 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, I haven't been idle. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.54,1:04:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.85,1:04:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是懒得知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you didn't care about…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.78,1:04:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表我不能欣赏它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I can't appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.06,1:04:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伍德布基家的电话答录机里有条信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Alex Woodbridge had a message on the answerphone at his flat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.37,1:04:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一位凯安斯教授 - 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A Professor Cairns. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.64,1:04:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 城市里最美的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. Nice part of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.06,1:04:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么要解释的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time you want to explain?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.44,1:04:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪汉消息网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homeless network.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的太重要了 - 流浪汉消息网？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really is indispensable. - Homeless network?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.40,1:04:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼线遍布整座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes and ears, all over the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.85,1:04:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's…clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.67,1:04:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他们喂点食 然后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you scratch their backs, and…?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.36,1:04:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 然后给自己消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, then disinfect myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.64,1:05:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在露宿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing sleeping rough?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.48,1:05:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长的很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he has a very distinctive look.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.63,1:05:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须藏起来避免闲话… 大多数闲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to hide somewhere where tongues won't wag…much.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.80,1:05:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他妈的… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh sh… - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.39,1:05:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真希望我… - 没关系 别提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish I… - Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.10,1:05:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.96,1:05:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再找到他又要花几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take us weeks to find him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.47,1:05:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能知道他要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I might have an idea where he might be going.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.52,1:05:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I told you,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.19,1:05:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给伍德布基留了言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone left Alex Woodbridge a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.94,1:05:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上没几个凯安斯教授 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can't be that many Professor Cairns in the book. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.00,1:05:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星 是太阳系的第五大行星 也是最大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter, the fifth planet in our solar system, and the largest.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.78,1:05:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星是一团巨大气体 地球只是它的十一分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter is a gas giant. Planet Earth would fit into it 11 times.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.80,1:05:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.66,1:06:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰坦是最大的卫星… - 出来呀 海王星\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Titan is the largest moon… - Come on, Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.08,1:06:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多已经熄灭多时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many are actually long dead…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.18,1:06:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.00,1:06:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸形成了超新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}…exploded into supernovas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.12,1:06:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,1864年被耶那维发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discovered by Urbain Le Verrier in 1846…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.28,1:06:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要由氢气组成\N{\fnArial\fs30}…composed mainly of hydrogen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.18,1:06:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,其光芒需要很多年到达地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their light takes so long to reach us…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.90,1:06:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golem!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.78,1:06:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多早已熄灭 爆炸形成了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…many are actually long dead, exploded into…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.32,1:06:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看不到他 我从背后 - 我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't see him. I'll go round. - I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.32,1:06:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次为谁工作 杜斯拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for this time, Dzundza?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.30,1:06:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球的前身 坍缩物质团主要成分是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A star begins as a collapsing ball of material composed mainly of…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.74,1:06:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golem!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.40,1:06:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.98,1:07:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.29,1:07:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳系的第四行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fourth planet of the solar system,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.87,1:07:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字取自罗马战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}named after the Roman god of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.04,1:07:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一团巨大气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it is a gas giant…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.52,1:07:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要很多年到达地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}…takes so long to reach us…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.90,1:07:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了超新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into supernovas…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.60,1:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸形成了超新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}…exploded into supernovas…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.32,1:07:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是伪造的 肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake. It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.11,1:07:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这画历经一切科学检测手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}That painting has been subjected to every test known to science.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.24,1:07:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是伪造的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a very good fake, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.31,1:08:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 对吧 是你吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about this, don't you? This is you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.25,1:08:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,探长 这是浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector, my time is being wasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.83,1:08:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能请你和你朋友出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind showing yourself and your friends out?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.66,1:08:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅画是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The painting is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.84,1:08:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此伍德布基和凯安斯被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake, that's why Woodbridge and Cairns were killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.20,1:08:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 证明过程只是细节 画是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, proving it's just a detail. The painting is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.58,1:08:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经解决了 我想出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've solved it, I've figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.80,1:08:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪造的 这就是答案 他们被杀的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake, that's the answer, that's why they were killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.70,1:08:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我来证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I'll prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.35,1:08:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我时间 给我时间好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me time. Will you give me time?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.90,1:08:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十 - 是个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ten… - It's a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.26,1:08:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 是个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God, it's a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.11,1:08:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说什么？- 十\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he say? - "Ten."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.35,1:08:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 九 - 他在倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nine… - It's a countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.18,1:08:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在给我时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's giving me time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.81,1:08:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天…是伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus… It's a fake,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.02,1:08:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怎么证明 怎么证明？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but how can I prove it? How?! How?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.53,1:08:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.54,1:08:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小孩会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kid will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.22,1:08:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我破绽在哪 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why the painting is a fake. Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.14,1:08:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七 - 不 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seven… - No, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.34,1:08:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别说 只能由我找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything. It only works if I figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.62,1:08:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有 就在我眼皮底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be possible. It must be staring me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.90,1:08:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Six… - How?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.88,1:08:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伍德布基知道 为什么？- 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Woodbridge knew, but how?! - Five…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.74,1:09:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's speeding up! Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.86,1:09:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四 - 在天文馆 你也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four… - Oh! In the Planetarium, you heard it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.98,1:09:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 太美妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is brilliant, that is gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.04,1:09:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 - 什么太棒了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three… - What's brilliant? What is?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.11,1:09:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美了 真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beautiful. Love this!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.32,1:09:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天文学者 超新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronomers, supernovas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.62,1:09:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two… - Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.62,1:09:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,范布伦超新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Van Buren Supernova.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.08,1:09:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问有人在吗？救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, is somebody there? Somebody help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.25,1:09:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你了 去找到他的位置 救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Go and find out where he is and pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.25,1:09:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的范布伦超新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Van Buren Supernova, so-called.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.29,1:09:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸中的星 只在1858年出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exploding star. Only appeared in the sky in 1858.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.00,1:09:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how could it have been…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.37,1:09:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1640年代被画出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}painted in the 1640s?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.74,1:09:47.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我的耐心有限 —麦克罗夫特·福尔摩斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.07,1:09:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherl…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.87,1:09:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真有趣 波西米亚信笺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's interesting. Bohemian stationery,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.07,1:09:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以布拉格传说为名的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}an assassin named after a Prague legend,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.29,1:09:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 温思莱斯小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, Miss Wenceslas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.92,1:10:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子充满了捷克气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole case has a distinctly Czech feeling about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.36,1:10:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that where this leads?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.30,1:10:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么罪 探长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we looking at, Inspector?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.30,1:10:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,刑事犯罪共谋 诈骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, criminal conspiracy, fraud,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.17,1:10:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,事后从犯 至少这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}accessory after the fact, at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.52,1:10:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀老妇一名 还有一屋子人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murder of the old woman, all the people in the flat…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.86,1:10:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.97,1:10:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不知道 求你了 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those things, please, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.34,1:10:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是参与分红\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted my share.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.22,1:10:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在阿根廷发现一个小老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a little old man in Argentina.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.76,1:10:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}A genius, I mean, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.37,1:10:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,画工 无懈可击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brushwork, immaculate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.89,1:10:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能糊弄过所有人 - 哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could fool anyone. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.92,1:10:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nearly anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.31,1:10:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我也不知道怎么说服世人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't know how to go about convincing the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.61,1:10:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅画是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the picture was genuine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.48,1:11:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.72,1:11:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他煽动我铸成大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spark which he blew into a flame.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.85,1:11:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.08,1:11:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.68,1:11:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.34,1:11:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了很久 但最终我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took a long time, but eventually I was…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.96,1:11:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些人接上了头\N{\fnArial\fs30}put in touch with people.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.20,1:11:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His people…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.44,1:11:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有过真正的联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there was never any real contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.14,1:11:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有留言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just messages…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.45,1:11:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳语\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whispers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.86,1:11:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些耳语有名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did those whispers have a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.64,1:11:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.48,1:12:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦斯特是在这里陈尸的？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this is where West was found? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.29,1:12:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会很久吗？- 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going to be long? - I might be.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.52,1:12:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是警察吗？- 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you the police, then? - Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.95,1:12:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恨他们 - 警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate 'em. - The police?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.54,1:12:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 卧轨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, jumpers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.06,1:12:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦在火车前的人 自私鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who chuck 'emselves in front of trains. Selfish bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.72,1:12:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这倒也是一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's one way of looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.45,1:12:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真生气 他们倒轻巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it. It's all right for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.75,1:12:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,几秒钟 草莓酱喷的满铁轨都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over in a split second, strawberry jam all over the lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.54,1:12:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the drivers, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.45,1:12:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就该认命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got to live with it, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.75,1:12:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 说到草莓酱 铁轨上没有血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, speaking of strawberry jam, there's no blood on the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.90,1:12:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经清理了吗？- 不 没这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has it been cleaned off? - No, there wasn't that much.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.61,1:12:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他脑浆迸裂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said his head was smashed in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.24,1:12:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可是没很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, but there wasn't much blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.26,1:12:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.83,1:12:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这儿看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll leave you to it, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.09,1:12:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走的时候叫一声 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give us a shout when you're off. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.93,1:13:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 韦斯特…在某处上车 真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so, Andrew West…got on the train somewhere. Or did he?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.52,1:13:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体上却没有车票\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no ticket on the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.24,1:13:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么陈尸这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he end up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.98,1:13:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 道岔拐角 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The points. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.21,1:13:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd get there eventually.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.24,1:13:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯特没死在这儿 所以血迹这么少\N{\fnArial\fs30}West wasn't killed here, that's why there was so little blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.88,1:13:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟踪我多久了？- 从一开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long have you been following me? - Since the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.42,1:13:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会以为我真会放弃这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I'd give up on a case like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.11,1:13:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了和我哥哥赌气吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to spite my brother, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.08,1:13:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 我们有个窃案要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we've got a bit of burglary to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.56,1:13:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,反导弹计划还没流出国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile defence plans haven't left the country,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.28,1:13:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则麦克罗夫特的人会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise Mycroft's people would have heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.43,1:13:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管人们怎么想 我们确实有特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite what people think, we do still have a secret service.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.53,1:13:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 我见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, I've met them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.86,1:13:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以偷记忆棒的人没法卖掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means whoever stole the memory stick can't sell it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.57,1:13:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或不知拿它怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}or doesn't know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.10,1:13:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我押后一种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}My money's on the latter.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.64,1:13:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.84,1:13:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.08,1:14:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 如果有人在家怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock! What if there's someone in?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.88,1:14:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.58,1:14:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.42,1:14:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.16,1:14:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没说吗 乔伊·哈里森的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, didn't I say? Joe Harrison's flat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.14,1:14:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe…?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.00,1:14:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯特未婚妻哥哥的家 他偷了记忆棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother of West's fiancee. He stole the memory stick,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.28,1:14:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死了他的未来妹夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed his prospective brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.41,1:14:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did he do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.12,1:14:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就问他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.42,1:15:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.80,1:15:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't meant to…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.82,1:15:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西会怎么说？老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Lucy gonna say? Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.43,1:15:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么杀他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.88,1:15:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是意外 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident. I swear it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.09,1:15:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可偷走反导弹项目计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stealing the plans for the missile defence program.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.99,1:15:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是意外 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't an accident, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.02,1:15:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我参与毒品交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started dealing drugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.42,1:15:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,自行车是个很好的掩护 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the bike thing's a great cover, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.32,1:15:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知从什么时候开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how it started.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.84,1:15:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越陷越深\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got out of my depth.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.67,1:15:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠人很多钱 危险的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owed people thousands. Serious people.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.46,1:15:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小韦快要订婚了 他开始谈他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then at Westie's engagement do, he starts talking about his job.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.12,1:15:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 平时他也很小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, usually, he's so careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.25,1:15:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可那一晚 几杯以后 他开始无话不谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that night, after a few pints, he really opened up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.57,1:15:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉了我这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me about these missile plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.62,1:15:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond top secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.24,1:16:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我看了记忆棒 在我面前晃着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed me the memory stick, he waved it in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.15,1:16:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种东西不是常丢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear about these things getting lost,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.86,1:16:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,落在垃圾堆里之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}ending up on rubbish tips and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.16,1:16:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它就在我眼前 所以我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there it was. And I thought…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.02,1:16:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得可能值一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought it could be worth a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.72,1:16:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿他东西太容易了 他烂醉如泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty easy to get the thing off him, he was so plastered.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.62,1:16:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我再见到他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time I saw him,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.49,1:16:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的表情告诉我 他知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could tell by the look on his face that he knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.92,1:16:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.84,1:16:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿导弹计划去做什么？- 你胡说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you done with the plans? - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.98,1:16:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.52,1:16:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备叫救护车 可已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to call an ambulance, but it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.57,1:16:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手足无措 就把他拖到了那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't have a clue what to do. So I dragged him in 'ere.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.55,1:16:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐在黑暗中 想着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just sat in the dark, think it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.20,1:16:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小聪明闯入你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a neat little idea popped into your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.79,1:17:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把韦斯特远远搬离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrying Andrew West way away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.32,1:17:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的尸体会接着走很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body would have gone on for ages.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.46,1:17:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果火车没有撞上变形道岔的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the train hadn't hit a stretch of track that curved.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.09,1:17:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者尖道岔 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And points. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.12,1:17:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆棒还在你这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still have it, then the memory stick?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.24,1:17:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧 如果不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch it for me, if you wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.68,1:18:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移注意力结束 游戏继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distraction over, the game continues.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.47,1:18:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许游戏也结束了 投弹手再没来消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's over, too. We've heard nothing from the bomber.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.22,1:18:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,五响 记得吧 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five pips, remember, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.82,1:18:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在倒数 现在只有四轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a countdown.We've only had four.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.70,1:18:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,错 错 错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.69,1:18:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然不是男孩的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of Course he's not the boy's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.28,1:18:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他牛仔裤的折痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the turn-ups on his jeans!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.59,1:18:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道这很危险 - 呃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it was dangerous. - Hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.24,1:18:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你看肥皂剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting you into crap telly.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.55,1:18:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和康妮·普林斯完全没法比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a patch on Connie Prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.30,1:18:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把记忆棒给麦克罗夫特了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you given Mycroft the memory stick yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.19,1:18:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,给啦 他心花怒放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. He was over the moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.41,1:18:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又拿授勋来威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threatened me with a knighthood…again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.02,1:18:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 我还在等呢 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, I'm still waiting. - Hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.27,1:18:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你承认 懂一点点太阳系知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you to admit that a little knowledge of the solar system.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.74,1:18:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你快速发现了假画的破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'd have cleared up the fake painting a lot quicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.75,1:18:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没赚到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't do you any good, did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.32,1:18:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可我又不是世上唯一的咨询侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I'm not the world's only consulting detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.11,1:18:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 我不回来喝茶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- True. - I won't be in for tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.51,1:18:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去莎拉家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to Sarah's.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.86,1:19:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱里还有些意大利饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still some of that risotto left in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.33,1:19:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没牛奶了 - 我去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Milk, we need milk. - I'll get some.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.55,1:19:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.17,1:19:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再买些豆子？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And some beans, then? - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.01,1:19:34.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布鲁斯-帕廷顿计划已找到 请自取）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.86,1:19:41.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游泳池 午夜）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.04,1:20:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你带了一个见面礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bought you a little getting-to-know-you present.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.44,1:20:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了这个 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it's all been for, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.94,1:20:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这些谜题 逼我起舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your little puzzles, making me dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.90,1:20:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都为了不让我注意这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All to distract me from this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.65,1:20:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.92,1:20:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒很刺激 对吧 夏洛克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a turn-up, isn't it, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.80,1:21:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 到底怎么…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! What the hell…?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.89,1:21:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,打赌你没料到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you never saw this coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.89,1:21:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 你想听我逼他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…would you like me to make him say…next?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.23,1:21:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「叽里呱啦 叽里呱啦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottle o' gear, gottle o' gear,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.44,1:21:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,「舌头打结啦」 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}gottle o' gear. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.60,1:21:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,地方不错 游泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice touch, this. The pool,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.78,1:21:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡尔死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where little Carl died.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.50,1:21:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了结了他 也可以了结约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped him. I can stop John Watson, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.10,1:21:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了结他的心跳 - 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop his heart. - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.78,1:21:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过你我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you my number.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.90,1:21:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等着你打来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might call.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.50,1:22:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不是英国陆军勃朗宁手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a British Army Browning.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.23,1:22:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,型号L9A1 在你口袋里凸着\N{\fnArial\fs30}L9A1 in your pocket,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.53,1:22:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你见到我兴奋了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you just pleased to see me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.86,1:22:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.19,1:22:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆·莫里亚蒂 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim Moriarty. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.85,1:22:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.20,1:22:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院那个吉姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim from the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.18,1:22:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我真的演得那么像啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did I really make such a fleeting impression?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.46,1:22:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我想 这就是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, I suppose, that was rather the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.84,1:22:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 别人拿着来福枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly. Someone else is holding the rifle.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.32,1:22:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想脏了我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like getting my hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.64,1:22:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过你暗示 夏洛克 一点点提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given you a glimpse, Sherlock, just a teensy glimpse.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.93,1:22:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我在那广大的世界做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}of what I've got going on out there in the big bad world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.24,1:22:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个专家 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a specialist, you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.00,1:22:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.81,1:22:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Jim…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.16,1:23:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问能帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…please will you fix it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.36,1:23:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱情人那讨厌的姐妹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get rid of my lover's nasty sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.94,1:23:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的吉姆 可以让我跑路去南美吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Jim, please will you fix it for me to disappear to South America?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.47,1:23:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.18,1:23:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「咨询罪犯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consulting criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.26,1:23:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厉害 - 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brilliant. - Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.00,1:23:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人找上过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one ever gets to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.46,1:23:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来也不会找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no-one ever will.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.56,1:23:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.36,1:23:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很接近了 现在你妨碍我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come the closest. Now you're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.00,1:23:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 这不是称赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Didn't mean it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.42,1:23:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是 - 好吧 算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you did. - Yeah, OK, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.19,1:23:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是调戏时间该结束了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the flirting's over, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.71,1:23:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's had enough now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.42,1:23:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我展示了我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've shown you what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.11,1:23:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解脱了那么多人 那么多小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut loose all those people, all those little problems,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.28,1:23:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃了三千万 只求你过来和我玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}even 30 million quid, just to get you to come out and play.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.96,1:23:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它看成一个友爱的警告吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take this as a friendly warning… my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.10,1:23:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.71,1:24:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我非常享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I have loved this,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.41,1:24:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们间的小游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}this little game of ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.36,1:24:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演IT员工吉姆 扮演同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing Jim from IT. Playing gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.65,1:24:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢我内裤的小把戏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you like the little touch with the underwear?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.22,1:24:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人为此死了 - 人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- People have died. - That's what people do!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.32,1:24:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会制止你 - 不 你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will stop you. - No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.55,1:24:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.82,1:24:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说话 小约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can talk, Johnny boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.52,1:24:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.32,1:24:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿去 - 嗯？哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it. - Mm? Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.41,1:24:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个？导弹计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that? The missile plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.07,1:24:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.94,1:24:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随便都可以拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have got them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.62,1:24:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.38,1:24:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.25,1:24:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.31,1:24:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的阻击手开枪 莫里亚蒂先生 我们都没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your sniper pulls that trigger, Mr Moriarty, then we both go up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.62,1:24:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好贴心哎 明白你为什么喜欢他在身边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he sweet? I can see why you like having him around.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.95,1:25:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 人总是对自己的宠物太心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, people do get so sentimental about their pets.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.71,1:25:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们忠诚得感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so touchingly loyal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.99,1:25:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 唉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But oops!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.63,1:25:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可露出破绽了 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've rather shown your hand there, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.04,1:25:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.07,1:25:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯特伍德西服 你知道不放过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westwood. Do you know what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.76,1:25:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有什么下场吗 夏洛克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't leave me alone, Sherlock? To you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.91,1:25:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 被杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, let me guess. I get killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.52,1:25:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.55,1:25:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别没创意了 当然有一天我会杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't be obvious. I mean, I'm going to kill you anyway, some day.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.54,1:25:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to rush it, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.22,1:25:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留着 来些特别节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving it up for something special.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.77,1:25:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 要是你继续多管闲事 我让你生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. If you don't stop prying, I'll burn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.82,1:25:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你像掏心一般痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll burn the heart out of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.90,1:25:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个可靠的人告诉我 我根本没有心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been reliably informed that I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.00,1:25:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们都知道这不太正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both know that's not quite true.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.69,1:26:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd better be off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.46,1:26:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算能有次像样的谈话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so nice to have had a proper chat.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.04,1:26:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我现在开枪射你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I was to shoot you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.77,1:26:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.15,1:26:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你可以好好珍藏我惊讶的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you could cherish the look of surprise on my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.22,1:26:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我会惊讶的 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos I'd be surprised, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.71,1:26:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.74,1:26:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后会有一点点…失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just a teensy bit…disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.52,1:26:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你也不会珍藏太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course, you wouldn't be able to cherish it for very long.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.82,1:26:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ciao, Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.12,1:26:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头…再抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch you…later.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.94,1:26:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.41,1:26:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗？你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.30,1:26:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我没事 我没事 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine. I'm fine. Sherlock…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.54,1:26:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.74,1:27:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.16,1:27:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 我？我没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you OK? - Me? Yeah, fine. I'm fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.71,1:27:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才…刚才你…你做的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, er…thing that you… that you did,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.76,1:27:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备为我做的…呃…挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, um…you offered to do… that was, um…good.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.26,1:27:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸好没人看到 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm glad no-one saw that. - Mm?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.63,1:27:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在黑暗的泳池边扒我衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ripping my clothes off in a darkened swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.98,1:27:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家会说闲话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People might talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.99,1:27:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就没别的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do little else.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.86,1:27:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 男孩们 我老是那么变化无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boys. I'm so changeable!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.27,1:27:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的缺点 可老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a weakness with me, but to be fair to myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.19,1:28:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的唯一缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is my only weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.23,1:28:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能允许你们继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be allowed to continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.50,1:28:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.28,1:28:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量说服你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would try to convince you,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.94,1:28:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我想说的 你大概都已经想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything I have to say has already crossed your mind.
